WEBVTT

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:02.430
You're changing to the music course?

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:07.150
Our school does have many courses and
they do allow students to change programs.

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:09.650
You really went for it, Yu-chan.

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:10.820
Yeah.

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.860
Ayumu's the one who gave me this chance, and...

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:16.820
All of you gave me the courage to do it.

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:18.700
We did?

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:22.410
Watching all of you work so hard
to become school idols

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:26.580
made me realize I should
try anything I really want to do.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:28.960
I see.

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:32.260
Well first, I still have to
take the transfer exam.

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:35.130
I'm not even sure if I'll pass.

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:37.550
Go for it, Yuyu!

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:39.220
We've got your back!

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:41.140
I think that's a wonderful dream.

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:44.640
Please let us know if there's
anything we can do.

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:48.900
I know. Someone in my dorm is in
the music course. Want me to talk to them?

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:52.860
I'll figure out what your test will
probably be like and what you should do.

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:58.030
W-Well, Kasumin's going to do
all kinds of things for Yu-senpai, too!

00:00:58.030 --> 00:00:59.490
Girls...

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:00.910
Thanks!

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:03.410
Let's do our best tomorrow, Yu-chan.

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:04.250
Yeah!

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:05.540
That's the spirit!

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:11.130
A festival for school idols, their fans,
and the people coming to see the show...

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:13.050
Let's make it a fantastic show!

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:14.970
Yeah!

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:22.220
<i>Let's go to the future!</i>
<i>Rainbow melodies</i>

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:27.480
"Nijigasaki High School Idol Club"
"Love Live!"

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:34.990
<i>The rain clears up and reveals blue skies</i>

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:37.990
<i>The winds of hope blow (Blowing)</i>

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:42.950
<i>We can feel something coming</i>
<i>and we take our very first step</i>

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:45.660
<i>The world is sparkling</i>

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:48.670
<i>And our hearts start to well up with (Feelings)</i>

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:53.050
<i>"We want to start running right now!!"</i>
<i>(Move on! Move on!)</i>

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:58.550
<i>The tiny melodies blend together (Our Colors)</i>

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:00.760
<i>Let's paint this arch, now</i>

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:04.350
<i>It resonates throughout the city</i>
<i>(Reaching for far blue sky!)</i>

00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:06.520
<i>Let's sing together!</i>

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:12.310
<i>My feelings are overflowing,</i>
<i>there's no stopping them now</i>

00:02:12.310 --> 00:02:14.980
<i>Rainbow-colored passions!!</i>

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:17.190
<i>Colors painted in courage</i>

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:19.860
<i>Let's create a bridge to the future</i>

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:23.330
<i>Beyond the endless sky</i>

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:25.620
<i>Resounding sympathy</i>

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:28.000
<i>Miracles are blooming</i>

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:31.210
<i>--Let's go! Shine towards the future, melodies</i>

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:33.670
<i>--Yes, I know I'm not alone</i>

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:36.340
<i>You're all always by my side</i>

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:42.390
<i>So let's connect our dreams together</i>

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:50.690
"Episode 13: School Idol Festival
(The Place Where Everyone's Dreams Come True)"

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:56.280
It's about to start!

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:57.900
Let's hurry!

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:00.070
Please don't run!

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:01.990
Here you go, Setsuna-chan.

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:05.490
After I write in it, I just need to
hand it off to Emma-san, right?

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:07.200
Yeah, if you would.

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.580
Hey, are you all ready?

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:12.750
Apparently Shinonome and Touou
are headed to their stages already.

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:14.880
Oh, is it that time already?

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:19.170
Shizuko, do my bangs look weird?

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:22.510
They're fine. You look adorable.

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:23.800
Thanks!

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:26.220
Come on, Kanata, wake up.

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:33.980
All right! Let's do this thing!

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:36.150
Ai-san, before that...

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:39.110
You've forgotten something very important.

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:40.780
Whoops, my bad!

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:46.200
If you would, Kasumi-chan.

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:47.990
Leave it to me!

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:50.910
Okay, let's do this!

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:53.710
Let's make our rainbow bloom!

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:00.840
One minute before show time.

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:09.310
Ten!

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:10.270
Nine!

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:11.310
Eight!

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:12.270
Seven!

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:13.310
Six!

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:14.310
Five!

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:15.270
Four!

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:16.270
Three!

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:17.360
Two!

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:19.110
One!

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:22.650
School Idol Festival, start!

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:36.880
Ayumu-chan!

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:44.470
Thank you, everyone!

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:53.350
Miss Idol!

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:06.320
Here you go!

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:08.320
What's this?

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:08.570
"Monja Miyashita"
"On Location!!"
What's this?

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:11.950
This is Monja Miyashita's special <i>monja</i> stick!

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.120
It's so good!

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:18.080
How do you like that <i>mon</i>-ster <i>ja</i>-m?

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:20.750
Because you know, <i>monja</i>.

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:24.550
Come one, come all!

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:37.140
Maybe I'll lay down for a bit.

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:46.740
Is this really okay?

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:53.040
It's a festival, so it sure is.

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:03.460
Me-ow!

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:06.920
Squeak!

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:15.980
--Yis.

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:19.650
That was over in an instant...

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:21.980
Rina-chan Board, yis.

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:22.940
Me next!

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:23.820
I wanna play, too!

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:25.190
Me, too!

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:28.070
I want to play with everyone, too.

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:38.750
Emma!

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:42.840
Who are all these kids?

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:44.750
They're all my new friends!

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.710
I wanna dance with you, Big Sis Emma!

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:48.050
Me, too!

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:51.890
Karin-chan, it's time to switch stages.

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:54.430
It's time already?

00:06:54.430 --> 00:07:00.100
Um... Where was my next stage again?

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:02.230
We'll lead the way!

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:03.650
Thanks.

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:19.200
School idols, huh?

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:21.080
You were saying you'd like to be one.

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:25.040
Yeah! I'm interested,
but I wonder if I could do it...

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:26.750
What are you talking about?

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:32.760
Your journey's already begun
the moment you wanted to become one.

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:34.390
R-Right!

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:45.560
Well, it looks like you're having a blast!

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:50.400
But the ones who'll shine brightest today
are Kasumin and her fans!

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:52.240
Kasumi-san?! What--

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:56.330
My moving stage I created
with the members of the Buns Club...

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:59.200
Kasumin on the Go!

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:01.830
Here we go!

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:05.580
Kasumin... Pretty Illusion!

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:07.340
I won't be able to sing like this!

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:10.050
Now, you're finished!

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:11.470
Hold it right there!

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:15.680
There may be countless school idols,

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:18.100
but I am the only school idol of justice!

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:22.770
Call for help, and I shall reply with a song!

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:25.690
My show starts now!

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:28.110
Shizuku Sky-Blue Hurricane!

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:32.190
Eekers! The wind's blowing away my smoke!

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:35.030
Your evil deeds end now!

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:36.160
Curse you!

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:38.080
Now's your chance, Setsuna-san!

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:41.290
Shizuku-san! Thank you for the assist!

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:46.540
Setsuna Scarlet Storm!

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:58.640
You won't get away with this!

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:03.600
I guess we saved the world again.

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:07.900
Here we go!

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:15.780
Yay!

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:19.830
Here you go, Kanata-chan.

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:23.410
Thanks. Looks like we'll make it in time.

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:24.790
Let's hurry and pass that around.

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:25.960
Yup.

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:30.920
Ayumu-san.

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:32.460
Himeno-chan.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:34.050
Are you all about to take a break?

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:37.510
Yes. How are you enjoying the concert?

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:39.260
It's a lot of fun!

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:41.640
We're enjoying ourselves as well.

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:43.680
Let's keep doing our best.

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:44.890
Yup.

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:49.400
Is there some kind of event going on?

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:53.150
Apparently, the local school idols
got together and are holding a festival.

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:54.070
Huh...

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:55.530
Please take one.

00:09:56.700 --> 00:10:00.530
Shinonome Academy
will be performing nearby soon!

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:04.370
It's going to be a blast,
so please check it out if you can!

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:06.080
That sounds like fun.

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:07.580
Wanna check it out?

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:09.500
Thanks!

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:10.750
Yu-chan!

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:13.210
Ayumu!

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:16.630
It sure is hot. Are you staying hydrated?

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:17.880
Yup.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:20.300
Have you been handing out
fliers this whole time?

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:21.180
Yup!

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:24.010
You should come see all of us perform, though.

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:26.890
Of course, I'd love to see you all,

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:30.270
but I want even more people to come see you!

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:35.230
Because this concert is something that
we all worked hard to bring to life!

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:41.530
How do I put this? I want some confidence.

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:48.370
I'm sure it's going to be difficult
to do something new.

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:54.670
So if I can make this festival
a success, I think I'll make it.

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:58.590
I feel like I don't have to be scared
and can pursue my dream!

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:01.090
I want that reassurance.

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:02.680
Yu-chan...

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:06.890
Hello?

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.680
What?! There's trouble with the equipment?

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:10.100
There's no sound?!

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:12.400
I'm heading over to Ai-chan's stage!

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:21.280
How's it going?

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:23.620
Rinari's looking at things right now.

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:27.910
Can you fix it?

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:30.290
Now we just need to restart.

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:35.590
All better.

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:38.800
Thank you so much, Rinari!

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:41.180
I just realized...

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:44.800
Is this the first time
I was useful to you, Ai-san?

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:48.890
What are you talking about?!

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:50.890
Why you little...

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:59.280
I haven't seen you make that face in forever!

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:00.650
Blushy blush.

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:07.870
Great work.

00:12:07.870 --> 00:12:09.160
Shizuko.

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:11.500
I thought that went pretty well
for an improvised performance.

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:13.710
Everyone seemed to enjoy it!

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:18.130
W-Well, that's good.

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:19.510
Do you mind?

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:27.010
What's this?

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:28.890
A little something to thank you
for the drama festival.

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:31.390
I bought it because
I thought it'd look great on you.

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:47.410
This is the best!

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:53.540
Does that work?

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:55.330
Yup, I think that's good.

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:57.460
Looks like we did it.

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:02.840
We'll all be able to get together
after the collab set with Shinonome.

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:11.470
Oh, no! It's raining!

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:20.110
This isn't good.

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:22.110
How are everyone's performances?

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:24.320
They've all been put on hold.

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:26.700
But the weather report said
it'd be sunny today.

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:31.200
Hey, how long can we perform?

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:33.540
Until 7 PM.

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:35.370
What about the upcoming performances?

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:38.670
We might have to figure
something else out if this continues.

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:51.390
What do we do?

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:17.410
It finally stopped raining.

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:18.670
But...

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:27.170
Is it all just over then?

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.590
Yeah...

00:14:29.550 --> 00:14:35.640
We won't be able to use the stages anymore,
and I'm sure everyone went home.

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:38.140
I can't believe it ended this way...

00:14:38.140 --> 00:14:39.810
It's not the end though!

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:44.400
We can't let it end like this.

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:47.280
There's still something we need to say.

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:52.490
The rain's stopped!

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:54.200
Everyone's waiting!

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:55.700
Everyone?

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:57.370
Everyone's still here!

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:58.370
Look!

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:08.880
The vice president talked to the school
so we could do one more performance!

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:12.760
There are people left still at all the stages!

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:15.060
So it's not over yet!

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:18.770
We'll make it if we run!

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:20.730
Let's get going!

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:22.020
Let's hurry!

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:23.190
We need to go, too!

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:24.690
Dash!

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:31.280
Come on, Yu-chan.

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:05.150
Everything's ready, Nijigasaki.

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:08.280
Please get our message across.

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:09.860
Thank you.

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:12.530
Yu-chan.

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:16.870
We want you to watch this
performance from the audience.

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:17.870
Huh?

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:35.760
Thank you to everyone who
came to our final performance

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:40.100
and to everyone watching it on the monitors.

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:45.980
Thank you for having such
a wonderful time with us today!

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:49.860
There were a few incidents,

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:54.110
but we're able to stand on
this stage because of all of you!

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:59.280
We were able to go to various stages
and connect with all of you.

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:02.330
It was such an important day for us!

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:06.790
The School Idol Festival is a place
to make everyone's dreams come true.

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:12.340
In our club, we started walking towards
our dreams to become school idols

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:15.720
not as groups, but as individuals.

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:19.300
Chasing our dreams by ourselves was not easy,

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:22.810
and we all had our own obstacles to face.

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:25.690
But each time, we had someone
there to support us,

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:29.480
and we were finally able to make
a huge dream come true today.

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:33.740
We're individuals, but we're not alone!

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:36.570
You've all supported us this far,

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:40.910
so now, we'll support all of your dreams!

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:48.460
I'm sure we'll still stumble along the way...

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:51.710
Just like you've supported me this whole time,

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:54.260
I'm here for you, too!

00:17:56.800 --> 00:18:02.060
We all share this feeling,
so we're going to sing this together.

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:04.520
This song for you!

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:49.220
There's no way everything goes
the way you want it to.

00:20:49.220 --> 00:20:53.350
You actually end up having a lot of regrets.

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:55.440
But...

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:06.120
Look, everyone.

00:21:06.120 --> 00:21:10.080
We've got emails from various schools
about the same thing.

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:14.420
"We heard about the
School Idol Festival on the internet.

00:21:14.420 --> 00:21:17.170
We'd love to participate next time!"

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:18.210
These are...

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:23.340
There were quite a few videos
from the festival, so that might be why.

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:27.970
Well, that's great. Everyone's talking
about it at our school, too.

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:31.560
Everyone! Look at this!

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:34.640
We've got letters from all over the world!

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:39.610
That's amazing. I guess we're going to
have to have a second one now.

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:42.400
I'm getting fired up!

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:47.610
Hopefully next time, it'll be an event
we can enjoy with even more people.

00:21:47.610 --> 00:21:50.030
What's wrong, Ayumu-san?

00:21:50.030 --> 00:21:52.910
It's nothing. I was just thinking...

00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:56.710
I'm so glad I decided to do this!

00:22:24.860 --> 00:22:27.660
<i>As we slowly run down this path</i>

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:31.530
<i>Something is trying to come to life</i>

00:22:31.530 --> 00:22:38.370
<i>I want to tell you, I want to tell you that</i>

00:22:38.370 --> 00:22:41.170
<i>The sky that we look up at every day</i>

00:22:41.170 --> 00:22:45.130
<i>Has a blue that changes with the seasons</i>

00:22:45.130 --> 00:22:51.760
<i>There are no rules, it's telling us</i>
<i>to depict it however we please</i>

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:54.060
<i>Let's not be in a hurry!</i>

00:22:54.060 --> 00:22:58.520
<i>Let's enjoy this thrilling time even more!</i>

00:22:58.520 --> 00:23:06.610
<i>Let's all pursue the things that we love</i>

00:23:07.530 --> 00:23:10.990
<i>We don't know where we're headed to just yet</i>

00:23:10.990 --> 00:23:14.080
<i>Hopefully, there's an exciting</i>
<i>future awaiting us</i>

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:18.580
<i>It'd make me happy</i>
<i>if we can both smile about that</i>

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:21.210
<i>Thank you again today</i>

00:23:21.210 --> 00:23:24.460
<i>Now, let us open up our very own maps</i>

00:23:24.460 --> 00:23:27.630
<i>And casually take flight</i>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:32.930
<i>I want to dream, aspire, and dream once again</i>

00:23:32.930 --> 00:23:37.140
<i>I just want to keep dreaming!</i>
